# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DOMAIN CANONICALIZATION (Jun 2026)
# This Netlify site serves BOTH nepooloperator.com (canonical brand domain)
# and the legacy solaroperator.org. Rules below 301 the legacy domain's
# USER-FACING entry routes to nepooloperator.com so the funnel is clean.
#
# NOT redirected (kept dual-domain on purpose):
#   /v1/*      — API proxy. A 301 across a POST risks dropping the body, and
#                the extension/API callers expect a stable host.
#   /accounts* — dashboard SPA. The Chrome extension's so_bridge.js pairs by
#                injecting on the dashboard tab; the PUBLISHED store extension
#                still matches solaroperator.org, so redirecting /accounts off
#                that host would break pairing for live users until the new
#                (nepooloperator.com-matching) extension is published. Once
#                v1.7.1+ is live in the store, we can add /accounts to the 301.
# Host-scoped rules only fire for the solaroperator.org host, so the
# nepooloperator.com alias never matches them (no redirect loop).
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Marketing homepage → canonical brand domain (force, even though / has content).
https://solaroperator.org/            https://nepooloperator.com/            301!
https://www.solaroperator.org/        https://nepooloperator.com/            301!

# Onboarding wizard entry → canonical brand domain (THE reported bug: the
# NEPOOL door / legacy links landed users on solaroperator.org/onboarding).
https://solaroperator.org/onboarding      https://nepooloperator.com/onboarding         301!
https://solaroperator.org/onboarding/*    https://nepooloperator.com/onboarding/:splat  301!
https://www.solaroperator.org/onboarding      https://nepooloperator.com/onboarding         301!
https://www.solaroperator.org/onboarding/*    https://nepooloperator.com/onboarding/:splat  301!

# Legacy signup aliases → canonical onboarding on the brand domain.
https://solaroperator.org/signup          https://nepooloperator.com/onboarding/  301!
https://solaroperator.org/signup.html     https://nepooloperator.com/onboarding/  301!
https://solaroperator.org/get-started     https://nepooloperator.com/onboarding/  301!

# ── Backend API (Railway) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# The dashboard + onboarding SPAs call the API with relative /v1/* paths and
# assume same-origin. Proxy them to Railway so they work from EITHER domain.
# (Stripe webhooks + the Chrome extension still hit Railway directly.)
/v1/*                 https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/v1/:splat   200

# ── Account dashboard SPA (served at /app/* on Railway) ─────────────────
# Status-200 proxy so the address bar shows <domain>/accounts. Dual-domain on
# purpose (see header note re: published extension pairing).
/accounts             https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/app/   200
/accounts/*           https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/app/:splat   200

# ── Demo entrypoint (homepage "Try a sample account" CTA) ───────────────
# Clean URL for the static redirect page. The page itself calls the API via
# the same-origin /v1/* proxy above, so no extra API rule is needed here.
/demo-account         /demo-account.html   200

# ── Legacy signup entrypoints → onboarding wizard (same-origin fallback) ─
# These fire for the nepooloperator.com host (the solaroperator.org host is
# already caught by the host-scoped 301s above). Keeps relative links working.
/signup               /onboarding/   301
/signup.html          /onboarding/   301
/get-started          /onboarding/   301

# ── Onboarding wizard SPA (served at /onboarding/* on Railway) ──────────
# SPA proxies — user sees <domain>/onboarding/... while Netlify serves Railway
# content. Status-200 rewrite so the address bar stays clean. (Fires for the
# nepooloperator.com host; solaroperator.org is 301'd above.)
/onboarding           https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/onboarding/   200
/onboarding/*         https://web-production-49c83.up.railway.app/onboarding/:splat   200
